<form class="workspace-request" data-workspace-form>
  <label for="workspace-request">What are you trying to get done?</label>
  <p>Write naturally. Misspellings and incomplete phrasing are okay. The translator will expose assumptions instead of hiding them.</p>
  <textarea id="workspace-request" name="request" rows="5">improve the Markdoc architecture guide and make the provider fallback clear</textarea>
  <button type="submit">Interpret request</button>
  <small>This creates a local prompt preview. It does not invoke Claude or Codex.</small>
</form>
